WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.919
- When you see her,

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.587
when you see him,

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:08.591
that is generations manifested and woven
into the fabric of these games.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:12.053
Those 81 points, that nine-five-eight,

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.515
those 23 Grand Slams...is our alchemy.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:20.061
Our essence is encrypted into the moments
that stand the test of time.

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:21.312
- [Announcer:] Return to glory.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:25.316
- The soul of athletics lies within her,
lies within him...

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.819
- [Deion Sanders:] Who is SWAC?
- lies within us.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:29.904
The beauty in the game
is the beauty in our name.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.365
Our sisterhood, our brotherhood,

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.034
family ties.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.702
- [LeBron James:] Black history month is every month.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:39.456
- The fits, the nails, the braids,
the 'fros, the chains.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:42.083
The lingo is baked in.
- [Jamaal Williams:] It’s all dawg around this mug.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:46.963
- We’ve rebelled, we’ve shined, we’ve
laughed, and we’ve danced.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.216
Our value cannot strictly
be tied to accolades

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:52.510
because something bigger was achieved.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.013
- [Kevin Garnett:] Anything's possible!

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:59.017
- We've gifted sports with identity, spirit
and culture.

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:02.937
Sports has a purpose...because, you know,

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.565
all along, it's always been Black.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.902
Cuz all along, it's always been Black.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:10.445
- [Lamar Jackson:] Not bad for a running back.

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:12.947
- Cuz all along, it's always been Black.

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:14.616
- [Sam Washington:] Tell 'em to bring me my money.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:19.913
- Sports history is Black history.

